flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Pose as an influencer, con your way into the showroom, and steal a high-end supercar."])
 _A0_(["The team arrives, stating they’re booked for a video shoot featuring the supercar."])
 _A1_(["After checking the booking schedule, the salesperson finds nothing."])
 _A1_C1_{"Imitator flirts with the salesperson, insisting his boss agreed to it."}
 _A1_C1F_["The salesperson reiterates that he has no record of this booking being made."]
 _A1_C2_{"Car Thief threatens to give the business a bad review on its social media channel."}
 _A1_C2P_["Scared of being called out online, the salesperson gives in, telling them to be quick."]
 _A2_(["The team begins blocking out the first shot."])
 _A2_Cont1_(["Car Thief asks if the car&#39;s headlights can be turned on to illuminate the scene."])
 _A2_Cont2_(["The salesperson complies, fetching the key fob from a locked cabinet."])
 _A2_1_(["The car&#39;s lights are turned on and Imitator starts snapping some photographs."])
 _A2_C1_{"Needing time to investigate the car, Imitator cheekily asks for some refreshments."}
 _A2_C1P_["The salesperson agrees to the request after being offered a part in the video."]
 _A3_(["Car Thief orders a caramel macchiato blended with a hazelnut soya latte."])
 _A3_1_(["Imitator requests a black coffee with two tea bags and milk added."])
 _A3_2_(["Puzzled by their orders, the salesperson walks off, returning the key fob to the drawer."])
 _A3_3_(["Hustler #1 and Hustler #2 arrive to distract the other employee."])
 _A3_C1_{"Car Thief pulls out an RF detector and scans the car for wireless trackers."}
 _A3_C1F_["Car Thief fails to locate any tracking devices on the car."]
 _A3_C2_{"Car Thief gets into the car to perform a more thorough search."}
 _A3_C2P_["Car Thief finds a GPS tracker secreted under the car&#39;s dashboard."]
 _A4_(["The salesperson returns to clarify the team&#39;s bizarre drinks orders."])
 _A4_1_(["With the car heavily monitored, the tracker can&#39;t be removed without causing a scene."])
 _A4_2_(["Hustler #1 stokes competition by declaring interest in the vehicle."])
 _A4_3_(["Hustler #2 suggests that they purchase the car with their recent lottery winnings."])
 _A4_4_(["The salesperson leaps on this opportunity and invites them to the sales lounge."])
 _A4_5_(["As negotiations begin, Hustler #1 insults the salesperson&#39;s expertise."])
 _A4_C1_{"Hustler #1 and Hustler #2 ask for the other, more informed rep to join them."}
 _A4_C1F_["Unwilling to split his commission, the salesperson resists this suggestion."]
 _A4_C2_{"Hustler #2 insists they will only do the deal through the other salesperson."}
 _A4_C2P_["Dejected, the salesperson wanders off to get his colleague."]
 _B2_(["With both salespeople busy with the negotiation, the team gets back to work."])
 _B2_Cont1_(["Car Thief returns his attention to the GPS tracker."])
 _B2_Cont2_(["Meanwhile, Imitator heads to the office to snatch the supercar&#39;s key fob."])
 _B2_Cont3_(["Imitator finds the locked cabinet and kicks it open, retrieving the fob."])
 _B2_Cont4_(["Try as he might, Car Thief can&#39;t manage to pry the tracker from the dashboard."])
 _B2_1_(["Car Thief tries to remove the tracker in haste, triggering the car&#39;s alarm."])
 _B2_2_(["The salesperson rushes out to check on the car, pursued by Hustler #1."])
 _B2_C1_{"Feigning insult, Hustler #1 asks the salesperson if he has somewhere better to be."}
 _B2_C1F_["The salesperson insists he&#39;ll only be a minute and tells Hustler #1 to calm down."]
 _B2_C2_{"In desperation, Hustler #2 starts rolling on the ground, faking an asthma attack."}
 _B2_C2P_["The salesperson rushes to Hustler #2&#39;s aid."]
 _B2_5_(["The negotiations are put on hold as everyone focuses on Hustler #2&#39;s health."])
 _B2_6_(["Car Thief covertly destroys the tracker before Hustler #2 recovers."])
 _B3_(["With the vehicle now untraceable, the team gets in the car and readies to leave."])
 _B3_1_(["Car Thief starts the engine and it bursts into life with an almighty roar."])
 _B3_2_(["This draws the attention of a security guard, who storms over and thumps on the window."])
 _B3_C1_{"Imitator shows the guard the key fob, insisting they&#39;ve just bought the vehicle."}
 _B3_C1P_["The guard buys it but insists Imitator waits for him to check with the office."]
 _B3S_(["As soon as the guard turns his back, Car Thief floors the gas, accelerating away."])
 _A1_C2F_["The irate salesperson curses at Car Thief, telling him to do his worst."]
 _A1_C3_{"Imitator tries their luck with another salesperson, hoping for a better response."}
 _A1_C3P_["The second salesperson agrees to the request, saying it&#39;ll be good for business."]
 _A3_C1P_["The detector locates a GPS tracking device somewhere near the driver&#39;s side."]
 _A4_C2F_["The salesperson continues to refuse, accusing the team of being prejudiced."]
 _A4_C3_{"Hustler #2 storms out, threatening to sue the salesperson for this libelous claim."}
 _A4_C3P_["Not wanting to lose a sale, the salesperson relents and fetches his colleague."]
 _B3_C1F_["Noticing Imitator&#39;s nervousness, the guard rips the door open and drags them out."]
 _B3S2_(["Car Thief saves the mission by accelerating away, leaving his teammate behind."])
 _A2_C1F_["The salesperson refuses Imitator&#39;s request as he isn&#39;t allowed to leave the lot."]
 _A2_C2_{"Strolling over in a sultry fashion, Imitator turns on the charm."}
 _A2_C2F_["Imitator is a little too charismatic and the salesperson starts flirting."]
 _A2_C3_{"Car Thief confronts the salesperson, telling him he&#39;s being unprofessional."}
 _A2_C3P_["He apologizes and calms down, using the team’s refreshment request as an excuse to leave."]
 _A4_C3F_["The salesperson shrugs off Hustler #2&#39;s threat and lets him walk away."]
 _A4_6_(["Hustler #2 tries a new approach and starts complaining to the second salesperson."])
 _A4_7_(["Car Thief seizes the chance and tries to detach the GPS tracker covertly."])
 _A4_8_(["The salesperson notices what&#39;s going on and confronts Car Thief."])
 _A4_9_(["Car Thief and Imitator laugh off the incident and walk out of the lot."])
 _A4_10_(["When the salesperson goes to follow, Hustler #2 intervenes, demanding attention."])
 _A4F_(["The rest of the team leaves soon after, blaming the unprofessionalism of the salespeople."])
 _A4_C1P_["The salesperson reluctantly heads out to fetch his colleague."]
 _A5_(["Left alone, Car Thief returns to the car to access the GPS tracker."])
 _A5_1_(["Meanwhile, Imitator enters the office to swipe the supercar&#39;s key fob."])
 _A5_2_(["Imitator finds the locked cabinet and punches it open to retrieve the key fob."])
 _A5_3_(["Left alone, Car Thief returns his attention to the GPS tracker."])
 _A5_C1_{"Locating the tracker once more, Car Thief tries to remove it delicately."}
 _A5_C1F_["Try as he might, Car Thief can&#39;t detach the tracker from the car&#39;s wiring."]
 _A5_C2_{"Leaning in to take a look, Imitator tries to dislodge the tracker himself."}
 _A5_C2P_["Imitator uses targeted force to remove the tracking device."]
 _A5_4_(["The tracker is thrown to the floor and crushed by Imitator&#39;s boot."])
 _A2_C2P_["The salesperson softens and agrees to take their drink orders."]
 _A5_C1P_["Car Thief detaches the tracking device and destroys it with a stomp of her boot."]
 _A6_(["While his colleague finalizes the purchase, the other salesperson returns to the supercar."])
 _A6_1_(["Hustler #1 chases after him, hoping to buy the team more time."])
 _A6_C1_{"Hustler #1 tells the salesperson the deal is going south, requesting his help."}
 _A6_C1F_["The salesperson ignores Hustler #1, having spotted the others inside the supercar."]
 _A6_3_(["He pounds on the car window, ordering the team to step out immediately."])
 _A6_4_(["As Car Thief starts the car with the fob, the salesperson leaps onto the hood!"])
 _A6_C2_{"Car Thief accelerates then hits the brakes, hoping to lose the unwanted passenger."}
 _A6_C2P_["The salesperson flies off the hood and onto the road, cracking his skull on the asphalt."]
 _A8_R3_(["Car Thief speeds away from the showroom as the others emerge to investigate."])
 _A8S_(["With the salesperson drawn to the cries of his colleague, the rest of the team slips away."])
 _A1_C1P_["Charmed by Imitator, the salesperson gives in and leads them to the car."]
 _A6_C2F_["The salesperson rolls off the hood, leaps to his feet, and latches onto the car once more."]
 _A6_C3_{"Car Thief shifts into reverse, driving fast to finally throw the salesperson off."}
 _A6_C3P_["The salesperson loses his grip and tumbles onto the road."]
 _A9_R3_(["Eager to escape, Car Thief floors the accelerator, hitting a pillar on the way out."])
 _A9S_(["The rest of the team bolts while the salesperson checks on his stricken colleague."])
 _B2_C2F_["The salesperson claims he isn’t medically trained and summons security to help."]
 _B2_3_(["Alarmed by the security guards, Car Thief and Imitator survey the scene."])
 _B2_3_Cont_(["They fail to notice another guard behind them, who catches them with the RF detector."])
 _B2_4_(["The guard strongarms Car Thief toward the office as the second guard comes to help."])
 _B2F_(["Seeing the commotion from the window, the rest of the team departs in a hurry."])
 _A9_R2_(["Eager to escape, Car Thief floors the accelerator, hitting a pillar on the way out."])
 _A5_C2F_["Imitator removes it but his clumsy effort triggers the car&#39;s security alarm."]
 _C1_(["Hearing the noise, the salespeople rush out to investigate."])
 _C1_1_(["Car Thief dumps the tracker in his pocket and exits the car."])
 _C1_2_(["When questioned by the salesperson, Imitator feigns ignorance."])
 _C1_4_(["As the security guards approach, Hustler #1 and Hustler #2 make a run for it."])
 _C1F_(["When the tracker is found in Car Thief&#39;s pocket, the cops are swiftly called."])
 _A6_C1P_["The salesperson returns to the office, lured by the prospect of hijacking the sale."]
 _A7_(["Car Thief uses the key fob to start the car before driving off discreetly."])
 _A7_R3_(["Buzzed by the crew, Hustler #2 realizes it&#39;s time to go and fakes a change of heart."])
 _A7S_(["The team slips out of the showroom before anyone notices the car has been taken."])
 _A2_C3F_["The salesperson loses his cool and shoves Car Thief hard."]
 _A2_2_(["Car Thief falls backward into the car&#39;s side mirror, breaking it on impact."])
 _A2_3_(["The salesperson blames Car Thief and demands he pay for the damage."])
 _A2F_(["Car Thief and Imitator refuse to pay and walk off, abandoning the theft."])
 _B2_C1P_["He stops to apologize to Hustler #1, buying the team more time to remove the tracker."]
 _A8_R2_(["Car Thief speeds away from the showroom as the others emerge to investigate."])
 _A7_R1_(["Buzzed by the crew, Hustler #2 realizes it&#39;s time to go and fakes a change of heart."])
 _A7_R2_(["Buzzed by the crew, Hustler #2 realizes it&#39;s time to go and fakes a change of heart."])
 _A1_C3F_["The salesperson laughs in Imitator&#39;s face and tells them to leave."]
 _A1_1_(["Unaware of their teammates&#39; failure, Hustler #1 and Hustler #2 enter the lot."])
 _A1_2_(["The salesperson dismisses Imitator, stating he has genuine clients to assist."])
 _A1_3_(["Feeling insulted, Imitator smacks the salesperson over the head with his camera."])
 _A1_4_(["Car Thief demands that the other salesperson hands over the supercar&#39;s key fob."])
 _A1_5_(["The salesperson unlocks his desk and grabs the fob, covertly pressing an alarm button."])
 _A1_6_(["With the key fob acquired, Car Thief unlocks the car and the team gets in."])
 _A1_7_(["Before he can start the car, two security guards arrive and block their exit."])
 _A1_8_(["As one guard tries to get into the car, Car Thief locks the doors."])
 _A1_9_(["A salesperson uses a spare fob to unlock the car and Car Thief is dragged out."])
 _A1F_(["Imitator gives himself up as the heist comes to a disappointing conclusion."])
 _A3_C2F_["After combing every inch of the car&#39;s interior, Car Thief&#39;s efforts are fruitless."]
 _A3_4_(["Imitator asks for the detector, unaware that the salesperson has returned."])
 _A3_5_(["Caught with the device, Imitator leaps into the car, and Car Thief follows."])
 _A3_6_(["The salespeople rush over and trap the team before Imitator can start the engine."])
 _A3_7_(["With their teammates captured, Hustler #1 and Hustler #2 slope off quietly."])
 _A3F_(["Car Thief and Imitator are apprehended by security and arrested."])
